# What a board leaves out is reported once, and again only when it changes (#303's review,
# M2): a duplicate reads the workspace again, its message stays its time, and nothing is
# reported after it. tests/drive.rs writes Ashfall.canvas, with a card whose id is empty,
# which the engine doesn't take.
size 160x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
wait-for canvas couldn't read Ashfall.canvas: card 1 (id "") is left out
wait-gone canvas couldn't read Ashfall.canvas
wait-for ? help  q quit
wait 500ms
expect-not couldn't read
keys p
type kilauea
wait-for 1 notes
keys enter
wait-for Volcanoes/Kīlauea  reading
keys D
wait-for duplicated as Kīlauea 1 · R rename
wait-for example-workspace 36 notes
wait 1500ms
expect duplicated as Kīlauea 1 · R rename
wait-gone duplicated as
expect-not couldn't read
keys esc
wait-for ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
